    "text": "Sullivan County, New York\nScary Accident Scene Getting To Familiar in New York State\nBy Paty Quyn,\n24 minutes agoToday in Sullivan County, we had another incident of a driver crashing in a work zone. This time it was on Route 17, and the information shared by the Rock Hill Fire Department included some very serious pictures. The Rock Hill FD wants us to remember that as we get further into summer, we will see more visitors to the area.",
